{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰ってすぐ寝てしまったため\n更新遅くなりました(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の順位は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13時〜　8位　189票"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17時〜　4位　228票"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした(*_*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/10/3674232/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千秋楽で自分の中の最高順位をとれて\n本当に嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票してくださったみなさん\n本当に本当にありがとうございます○┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここだけの話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の今回の公演の目標は\n14位より上の順位にたつことでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16個全部の役を覚えるのは前提だけど\n通しのリハの練習のときは\nスタッフさん側の予測で練習していました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"練習だからみんな場所は変わるのに\n私だけはいつも14番の位置しか\nやらせてもらえませんでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたまだとは思うけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから単純だけど\nスタッフさんの予測する14位よりは上に立ちたい\nっていう気持ちがあって\nそこが目標でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\n達成できてすごい嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと中田の順位"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10位、9位、12位、5位、13位、11位、6位、8位、4位"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は9回とも役が一回もかぶらなかったから\nそういう意味では\nいろんな役をできた\n一番この公演で充実できたかも(*゜ロ゜)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、チェシャ猫になりきるのが一番楽しかったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/10/3674232/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の公演\n正直、毎日毎日\nステージに立ってるときは楽しいけど\nステージから降りればすぐ\n明日の公演についてだけずっと考えて\n精神的にも辛くて\n苦手な自己ＰＲも考えて\n「もうやだ」が口癖でした←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でも\nいろいろ成長できたかなって思います(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ブログでも書いてた\n自分探し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日自己ＰＲ考えてく中で\n少しはわかったかなーと思います｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/10/3674232/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大閃光さん\nお世話になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}